- **正式タイトル**: *Distributive and procedural justice: Combined impact of voice and process outcome on satisfaction*
- **掲載元 / DOI**: Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 35(2), 108–119 / https://doi.org/10.1037/0022-3514.35.2.108
- **手元保有実体PDF**: `Colquitt, J. A., et al..pdf (メタ分析内引用照合)`
